<tr id="S4.T2.5.17" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T2.5.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">DynaMoN (MS&amp;SS) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib38" title="" class="ltx_ref">38</a>]</cite></th>
