<th id="S4.T6.6.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">UniDepthV2 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib3" title="" class="ltx_ref">3</a>]</cite></th>
<td id="S4.T6.6.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">4.776</td>
